# DESK14 probe -- open Options -> "Read .INF file..." and stop with the file
# selector up, so its FSOK/FSCANCEL/F1..F9 rectangles reach the serial line
# (method/desk14_patch.py). Click points for the real runs come from that dump.
#
#   Options title centre ~ (196, 8)  (" Desk " 16..64, " File " 64..112,
#   " View " 112..160, " Options " 160..216).
#   Options drop-down: box at x=160, entries 16 px tall from y=19:
#     0 Set background...        19..35
#     1 Install icon...          35..51
#     2 Install application...   51..67
#     3 Install devices          67..83
#     4 Remove desktop icon      83..99
#     5 ----                     99..115
#     6 Set preferences...      115..131
#     7 Desktop configuration...131..147   (DESK05 confirmed: centre 139)
#     8 Change resolution...    147..163
#     9 ----                    163..179
#    10 Read .INF file...       179..195   -> centre (200, 187)
#    11 Save desktop...         195..211
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark B_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 187
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 240
4000 mark C_FSEL
